A NEW BASELINE ON NEW SILICON: x86_64 ZEN 4 UNDER WSL2 (`lilith`), TREE
7ec5b5572 -- NOT COMPARABLE TO THE aarch64 arm9/arm10 POSITIONS OR TO THE
r7900x CALLGRIND RATIOS. READ IT AS ITS OWN STARTING POINT.

date:   2026-09-05 (runs from 19:52 UTC; per-arm timestamps in each .meta)
